          "date": "2026-10-06T11:13:16Z",
          "body": "Ruslan Task Approval / migration review — APPROVED\r\nReviewed the merged MS7-V02 grades catalogue follow-up and its migration scope against the accepted R02A contract and Issue #23.\r\nReviewed scope:\r\n- GET /api/v1/grades/ implementation and Content ownership;\r\n- real Grade.id vs school number semantics;\r\n- cursor pagination and public read-only behavior;\r\n- additive content.Grade.created_at migration;\r\n- preservation of existing Grade IDs, relationships and bootstrap behavior;\r\n- upgrade/fresh PostgreSQL verification;\r\n- grades → V02 onboarding integration;\r\n- unchanged frozen R02A artifacts and wire contract.\r\nThe final PR head 8334f9a22ed09fa25dd27c42fe759b495fceb033 passed CI run 37203374678. Ilya's separate I03 consumer handoff approval is already recorded.\r\nNo blocking backend or migration findings remain.\r\nTask Approval: APPROVED by Ruslan.\r\nMigration review: APPROVED.\r\nThis comment records the missing human acceptance ledger entry retrospectively after merge; it does not introduce new implementation changes."
